/-- Paper Theorem A.3(i): local just identification rules out nontrivial dual-cone directions. -/
theorem noNontrivialInnerDual_underLocalJustIdentification
    {H : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup H] [InnerProductSpace ℝ H] [CompleteSpace H]
